Date: Thu, 27 Apr 2023 15:51:47 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 039/191] fbdev: andes: ftlcdc100: Update kernel configuration
 to support the framebuffer feature.

1. Support framebuffer function.
2. Fix kernel panic problem when running "cat /dev/fb > /mnt/fb_img".
3. Source code is modified to match Linux coding style.
4. Update kernel configuration to support the ALSA feature.
5. Adjust the video buffer size to meet PPMA requirements.

Signed-off-by: CL Wang <cl634@andestech.com>
